        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PR-GNT625/BST03002R, Garnet Reed Back-to-Back Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Back-to-Back Garnet Reed Door Pull comes packaged as a set with 2 pulls back-to-back mounted and 2 sets of matching rosettes. This pull can be mounted on glass, fiberglass, metal, or wood doors. Choose from a large selection of finishes. Due to the reeded detailing on both the Garnet Series 1 Pull and the Boston Rosettes, we think finishes that accentuate the style such as aged brass or antique brass look stunning on this pair of pulls. The Garnet Reed Back-to-Back Door Pull Set is available in 8 inch, 10 inch, and 12 inch lengths. \r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Includes lock down threaded rosettes to securely tighten the door pulls to the door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available as a <a href=\"/products/garnet-reed-door-pull-first-impressions-gnt625rddcrgsbr\"><b>First Impressions Garnet Individual Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions Garnet Door Pull with Boston-3R Rosettes:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-810R-detailed-picture.jpg?v=1704354588\"><b>First Impressions PR-GNT625/BST03002R Detailed Picture</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-GNT01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262222\"><b>First Impressions PR-GNT625/BST03002R Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>PR-GNT625008RDDCRGSBR/BST03002R:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PR-GNT625010RDDCRGSBR/BST03002R:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 7-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PR-GNT625012RDDCRGSBR/BST03002R:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 9-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: These door pulls are hand assembled in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back to Back mounting</b>.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Back-to-Back Garnet Reed Door Pull",
                "description": "The Back-to-Back Garnet Reed Door Pull comes packaged as a set with 2 pulls back-to-back mounted and 2 sets of matching rosettes. This pull can be mounted on glass, metal, or wood doors. Choose from a large selection of finishes. Due to the reeded detailing on both the Garnet Series 1 Pull and the Boston Rosettes, we think finishes that accentuate the style such as aged brass or antique brass look stunning on this pair of pulls. The Garnet Reed Back-to-Back Door Pull Set is available in 8 inch, 10 inch, and 12 inch lengths. \r\n",
